% Citations for the esmc_sae_feature_interpretation skill.
%
% The skill combines two lines of work: the ESM protein language models (whose
% internal representations are being interpreted) and sparse-autoencoder
% interpretability (the method used to decompose them). The specific codebook
% served by the Biohub API is a top-k SAE (k=64, 16,384 features) read off
% layer 60 of ESM C 6B; the top-k architecture is Gao et al.

